<title>USA: Industrial Bancorp Inc to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Industrial Bancorp Inc to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>BELLEVUE, Ohio 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial Bancorp Inc said Wednesday it plans to buy back five percent of its outstanding shares during the next 12 months.</p>
<p>The company's plan, which is subject to final approval of the Office of Thrift Supervision, calls for the repurchase of 277,725 shares.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
